=== what the pooled sample CAN rule out ===
  Kalshi vs Polymarket: any true gap larger than 0.48e-3 Brier would have been detected with 80% probability
    = a forecaster mispricing every game by 2.2pt in a fixed direction (a constant bias eps raises Brier by eps^2)
  Kalshi vs Sportsbook: any true gap larger than 0.36e-3 Brier would have been detected with 80% probability
    = a forecaster mispricing every game by 1.9pt in a fixed direction (a constant bias eps raises Brier by eps^2)
  Polymarket vs Sportsbook: any true gap larger than 0.51e-3 Brier would have been detected with 80% probability
    = a forecaster mispricing every game by 2.3pt in a fixed direction (a constant bias eps raises Brier by eps^2)

REPORT RULE: quote MDE alongside every subgroup null. Leagues flagged
UNDERPOWERED above must be described as 'consistent with equivalence but
unable to detect it', never as evidence for it.
